      "number": 2,
      "day": 1,
      "subject": "Protein. Produce. Fiber. Fat.",
      "preview": "The simplest meal rule I know.",
      "cta": "See the full Reset",
      "url": "https://fitnessworld.pro/the-30-day-natural-wellness-reset/?utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=reset_welcome_v2&utm_content=email_2_meal_rule",
      "templateId": "ae0e81db-433d-4166-853f-c5070c1d480e",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hi there,"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Most diets fail because they hand you a meal plan you can't keep."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The Reset uses a method instead. Every meal gets four parts:"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            "Protein (eggs, yogurt, beans, fish, poultry)",
            "Produce (any fruit or vegetable you'll actually eat)",
            "A fiber-rich carb (oats, whole grains, brown rice)",
            "A healthy fat (olive oil, nuts, seeds, avocado)"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Try it for breakfast tomorrow: yogurt, berries, oats and walnuts. Four parts, one bowl."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "It works with your culture, your budget and your preferences. Nothing to buy."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The full Reset has more meal examples and a pantry list."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 3,
      "day": 3,
      "subject": "\"Natural\" doesn't mean risk-free",
      "preview": "How to judge a supplement in 60 seconds.",
      "cta": "See what's inside",
      "url": "https://fitnessworld.pro/the-30-day-natural-wellness-reset/?utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=reset_welcome_v2&utm_content=email_3_hype_or_help",
      "templateId": "d0953815-b003-4745-aaf1-67953f60bd68",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hi there,"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The wellness world is full of loud claims. \"Detox.\" \"Melts fat.\" \"Doctors hate this.\""
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Here are three quick questions to ask before you buy anything:"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            "Is there real research, or just testimonials?",
            "Is the dose on the label the dose that was studied?",
            "Does it interact with anything I take?"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "If a product can't pass those, keep your money."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The full Reset includes a Supplement Decision Flow, a Claim Filter + Common Myths tool, a Label, Dose + Interaction Check, and 19 evidence-aware profiles in the Wellness Reference Library."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "It's food-first by design. The challenge comes first and supplements come last."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "day": 5,
      "subject": "Everything in the Reset for $9.99",
      "preview": "79 pages, 10 tools, 19 profiles.",
      "cta": "Get the Reset",
      "url": "https://fitnessworld.pro/the-30-day-natural-wellness-reset/?utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=reset_welcome_v2&utm_content=email_4_whats_inside",
      "templateId": "1bb08d01-b10d-476d-8e0d-1d3930383d28",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hi there,"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "You've seen Days 1–3. Here's everything you get with the full Reset:"
        },
        {
          "type": "ul",
          "items": [
            "The 79-page, 30-day program: one practical action a day, Weeks 1–4",
            "Starting Point + Daily Wellness Score to see your progress",
            "The 4-Part Meal Method with meal examples and a pantry list",
            "10 done-for-you tools, from Kitchen Essentials to the Supplement Decision Flow",
            "Day 30 Check-In + your Personal Wellness Blueprint",
            "Bonus: the Wellness Reference Library, 19 evidence-aware profiles"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "All for $9.99. One-time purchase, no subscription, delivered by email."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "number": 5,
      "day": 7,
      "subject": "Day 4 is waiting",
      "preview": "Keep going, or start fresh this week.",
      "cta": "Get the full Reset",
      "url": "https://fitnessworld.pro/the-30-day-natural-wellness-reset/?utm_source=resend&utm_medium=email&utm_campaign=reset_welcome_v2&utm_content=email_5_day_4_waiting",
      "signature": "To your health, Fitness World",
      "templateId": "05819c0a-3660-4217-b8b3-e42fb235e6b0",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Hi there,"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "It's been a week since you downloaded the preview."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "If you did Days 1–3, nice work. Day 4 and the rest of the 30 days are in the full Reset."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "If you didn't start yet, that's normal. Life gets busy. The Reset is built for ordinary life: one action a day, progress, not perfection."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "This is my last email in this Reset series. If it isn't for you, no problem. You'll keep getting free tips only if you chose the optional email updates."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "If it is, it's $9.99 with the Wellness Reference Library included:"
        }
      ]
    }
